    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Getting a Mortgage in Spain as a Foreigner: What You Need to Know</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Getting a mortgage in Spain as a foreign national is absolutely possible — banks regularly lend to non-EU buyers. However, the terms are different from resident mortgages, and the documentation requirements can be extensive. Here's what to expect.</p>
  </div>
